。\n・沢山の世界を超えて再会を繰り返し、色んな経験をしたお2人ですので、そういう関係性が表す様に、カラフルで楽しくて、賑やかな雰囲気の一枚をお願い致します。\n・「レトロ風、トロピカル、ゲーセン、宇宙人、ピクセル・ゴースト、文房具」のモチーフをどちらでもご自由に使って大丈夫です。\n・ポーズや構図は他は何でも構いませんので、お気軽に描いてください！\n\n依頼内容に何か難しい点か問題点があれば、お気になさらずこの依頼をキャンセルしてください。ご検討のほど、何卒よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/2ltf9xeooyt", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1394696, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "雲丹園", "screen_name": "uninosono", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1551439992093753345/ViPBYwH3.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1414795900732338177/1780486105/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "video"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 2789543, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ふじ", "screen_name": "f_ukkami", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1610992944403877895/HAs7UX48.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/181528536/1710756543/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 2959748, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "海月ハット", "screen_name": "Kurage_Hat", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1649472739038875648/1EpJNJHW.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1649472629244563458/1767728753/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": 